M3 (Full-text search API) is complete. `GET /api/snippets?q=<term>` now filters across title, body, and tags using SQLite FTS5.

What was built:
- **FTS5 layer**: `snippets_fts` virtual table with insert/update/delete triggers keeping the index in sync
- **Tag indexing**: JSON tags flattened via `json_each` + `group_concat` at write time
- **Prefix search**: quoted terms with trailing `*` (e.g. `q=ids` matches "Extract ids from array")
- **Tests**: 6 search tests covering title, body, tag, no-match, ordering, and prefix search

All 19 tests pass along with the full quality bar.

